    {
      "id": "h:081d9bc2982a",
      "kind": "quran",
      "ar": "وَهُوَ مَعَكُمْ أَيْنَ مَا كُنتُمْ",
      "tr": "Inni Isa samiileefi dachii guyyoota jaha keessatti uumee; ergasii ‘Arshii’ irratti (ol ta’iinsa isaaf malu) ol ta’eedha. Waan dachii keessa gadi seenu nibeeka, waan ishee irraa ba’us, waan samii irraa bu’us, waan ishee keessa ol ba’us (ni beeka). Inni eessallee yoo jiraattan isin waliin jira. Rabbiin waan isin dalagdan hunda ni arga.",
      "translit": "",
      "tag": "published",
      "src": {
        "name": "Oromo Translation - Gali Ababor",
        "url": "https://quranenc.com/en/browse/oromo_ababor",
        "rights": "Attributed reuse, see SOURCES",
        "date": "",
        "ref": "57:4"
      }
    },
