      "tr": "Yeroo gabroonni kiyya Ana irraa si gaafatan “dhugumatti, Ani isaanitti dhihoodha” (jedhiin). Kadhaa kadhataatiif yeroo inni na kadhate nan owwaadha. naaf haa owwaatanu, nattis haa amananu, Akka qajeelaniif jecha.",
